# Two-Way Personal Voice Assistant Upgrade Plan

Upgrade the Smart Learn AI Agent into a complete human-like two-way personal voice assistant that not only receives voice input, but also speaks its response back to the user naturally (`LISTEN → UNDERSTAND → DECIDE → ACT → SPEAK`).

## Proposed Architecture & Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    UserVoice[User Speaks] --> STT[Speech-to-Text / WebSpeech & MediaRecorder]
    STT --> Agent[Smart Learn AI Agent Server Action]
    Agent --> Tools[Tool Executor / Student360 Analytics]
    Tools --> ResponseText[AI Response Text]
    ResponseText --> MarkdownCleaner[Markdown & Clean Speech Sanitizer]
    MarkdownCleaner --> TTS[Text-to-Speech Engine / SpeechSynthesizer]
    TTS --> Speaker[Agent Speaks Back Aloud]
```

## Key Requirements & Components

### 1. TTS Abstraction Layer
#### `[NEW] src/lib/ai/speech-synthesizer.ts`
- **Clean Speech Sanitizer**: Strips markdown formatting (`**`, `*`, `_`, `#`), JSON buttons (`[ACTION_BUTTONS...]`), bullet points, and raw URLs so spoken output is smooth and human-like.
- **Language & Voice Selection**: Detects Hindi/Hinglish vs English phrasing to select standard clear voices (e.g. `hi-IN`, `en-IN`, or browser native natural voice).
- **Interruptible Speech Control**: Provides `stopAssistantSpeech()` to immediately cut off speech when the user speaks or clicks a control.
- **Lifecycle Callbacks**: Provides `onStart`, `onEnd`, and `onError` handlers to drive UI state transitions (`SPEAKING` -> `DONE`/`IDLE`).

### 2. Voice Assistant State Machine & UI
#### `[MODIFY] src/features/analytics/components/SmartAgentDrawer.tsx`
- **Voice Mode Toggle**: `[ 🎤 Voice Mode: ON / OFF ]` button and status badge.
- **Full Voice State Indicators**:
  - `IDLE`: `🎤 Ready`
  - `LISTENING`: `🔴 Listening...`
  - `TRANSCRIBING`: `⏳ Understanding...`
  - `THINKING`: `✦ Thinking...`
  - `SPEAKING`: `🔊 Speaking...` (with `[ ⏹ Stop Speaking ]` button)
  - `DONE`: `🎤 Ready`
- **Auto-Speak in Voice Mode**: Automatically invokes `speakAssistantResponse()` when an agent response arrives if Voice Mode is enabled or input was given via voice.
- **Barge-in / Interruption**: When the user presses the microphone while the assistant is speaking, it immediately cancels active speech via `stopAssistantSpeech()` and transitions state to `LISTENING`.

### 3. Server / Security Integrity & Text Mode Compatibility
- No changes to server security: `GROQ_API_KEY` remains strictly server-side.
- Typed chat and voice mode share the exact same tool execution pipeline (`askSmartAgentAction`).
- Typed chat continues working seamlessly without forced auto-speech if Voice Mode is turned OFF.

